 "text": "After World War II, the US secretly hired Nazi scientists. It was called Operation Paperclip. More than 1,600 German scientists and engineers came to America. President Truman banned active Nazis. So officials cleaned up their files. One of them, Wernher von Braun, SS officer. His V-2 rockets were built by concentration camp prisoners. In 1969, his Saturn V rocket took Apollo 11 to the Moon. Here's the trick. One big success makes people forget the past. It's called the Halo Effect. Follow for more dark psychology.",
